+| `thread-busy.ts` ~171–206 `buildFleetStopAllMessage` | `scope.kind === "run"` → `orchestrator_run_id: scope.runId` + run-scoped confirm/title; `parent` / `none` → process-wide payload with honest “进程内全部” copy. |
